    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Doris Waithera Gathungu's journey from the growing town of Pondamali in west-central Kenya, to the industrious halls of Aga Khan University's (AKU) undergraduate medicine programme is a story of unparalleled brilliance and determination. As one of Kenya's brightest young minds, Doris's exceptional academic achievements set her apart as a leader in the making.",
